      "message": "fix(app): a refusal on a setup with no machine says so\n\nA turning or plasma op refused on a setup with no machine mounted\nsaid \"the setup's machine is a mill\", but an unmounted setup reads as\na mill only by default (the kind_of law), so the words misstated it.\nThe refusal is unchanged in verdict; only the clause differs: \"the\nsetup has no machine mounted\" when none is mounted, the mill wording\nkept when one is.\n\nPinned by the_family_door_names_both_sides, a_mounted_mill_refusal_names_the_mill\nand the_plasma_family_lives_on_a_plasma_table_only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nFixes #1291",
